    <body>
      <trans-unit id="title" approved="yes">
        <source>Reactions</source>
        <target state="final">Reaction (ການຕອບສະໜອງ)</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="short_description" approved="yes">
        <source>Manage incoming HTTP webhooks to external system</source>
        <target state="final">ຈັດການ HTTP webhooks ຂາເຂົ້າໄປຫາລະບົບພາຍນອກ</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="description" approved="yes">
        <source>Configure secure endpoints that allow external services to trigger actions in TYPO3. Respond to webhooks from GitHub, payment providers, form services, and other platforms to automate workflows.</source>
        <target state="final">ກຳນົດຄ່າຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ປອດໄພທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ບໍລິການພາຍນອກກະຕຸ້ນການເຮັດວຽກໃນ TYPO3. ຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ webhooks ຈາກ GitHub, ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຊຳລະເງິນ, ບໍລິການແບບຟອມ, ແລະ ແພລດຟອມອື່ນໆ ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="heading_text" approved="yes">
        <source>Reactions — Manage Incoming HTTP Webhooks</source>
        <target state="final">Reaction – ຈັດການ HTTP Webhooks ຂາເຂົ້າ</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="reaction_not_found.title" approved="yes">
